        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for resource-agents",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for resource-agents fixes the following issues:\n\n- Fixed multiple vulnerabilities related to unsafe tempfile usage.\n  (bsc#1146690, bsc#1146691, bsc#1146692, bsc#1146766, bsc#1146776, bsc#1146784,\n  bsc#1146785, bsc#1146787)\n- Fixed issues where the ocfmon user was created with a default password (bsc#1021689, bsc#1146687).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
